<!DOCTYPE html> 
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sue's Crafts</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf6e3 0%, #f5e6d3 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: #6b4c3b;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .header h1 span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8a87c, #d4896b);
            padding: 0 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: white;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #8b6b5a;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Image Container */
        .artwork-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .artwork-container img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(107, 76, 59, 0.2);
            border: 4px solid white;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .artwork-container img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.01);
        }

        /* Description Box */
        .description {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf0ea, #f5e6dd);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-left: 5px solid #d4896b;
        }

        .description h2 {
            color: #6b4c3b;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .description p {
            color: #5a4033;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .description .fun-fact {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #7a5d4a;
            border: 2px dashed #d4896b;
        }

        .description .fun-fact::before {
            content: "💕 ";
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        /* Button */
        .contact-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        .contact-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b4c3b, #8b6b5a);
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 18px 50px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(107, 76, 59, 0.3);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .contact-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(107, 76, 59, 0.4);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a5d4a, #9b7b6a);
        }

        .contact-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .contact-btn .emoji {
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: #a08473;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8d5c9;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 25px;
                border-radius: 20px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .description h2 {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
            }

            .description p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .contact-btn {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                padding: 15px 35px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🧶 Welcome to <span>Sue's Crafts</span>!</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">✨ Handmade with love, one stitch at a time ✨</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Artwork Image -->
        <div class="artwork-container">
            <img src="images/IMG_20211208_133409_049.webp" alt="Sue's beautiful crochet artwork of two dolls">
        </div>

        <!-- Description -->
        <div class="description">
            <h2>🌸 About This Piece</h2>
            <p>
                This adorable crochet creation features two sweet little dolls, 
                lovingly handcrafted with care and attention to every detail. 
                Their smiling faces and cozy outfits make them the perfect 
                companions for cuddles and playtime!
            </p>
            <div class="fun-fact">
                Did you know? These two best friends took over 15 hours to crochet! 
                Each stitch was made with love, and their little outfits are 
                completely removable for dress-up fun! 🧵
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Button -->
        <div class="contact-section">
            <a href="mailto:suesjeans@gmail.com" class="contact-btn">
                <span class="emoji">📧</span> Contact Us
            </a>
            <p style="margin-top: 15px; color: #8b6b5a; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                Have questions or want to commission a custom piece?<br>
                We'd love to hear from you!
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2026 Sue's Crafts | Handcrafted with ❤️</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>


.gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}
.gallery-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
